{
    "title": "Housy: House Cleaning Schedule",
    "description": "<b><h2>CLEAN YOUR HOME WITH HOUSY - CHORES TRACKER AND HOUSE CLEANING APP</h2></b>\r\n\r\nAre you looking for a free adhd cleaning & house chores tracker app with cleaning schedules that you\u2019ll actually keep using to help declutter your house?\r\n\r\nA home chore tracker and adhd organizer app that is easy to use and keeps you motivated to keep your house clean?\r\n\r\nMeet <b>Housy</b>, a simple house cleaning checklists and chore calendar app for adults that will help you declutter and keep your home clean all the time. Use it as your chores calendar to plan and organize adhd cleaning, as well as a chores tracker to know which chores were completed using the chore chart.\r\n\r\nHousekeeping, housing cleaning and home organization are easy with Housy!\r\n\r\n<b><h2>AUTO-GENERATED HOME CLEANING SCHEDULE</h2></b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Have structure and discipline in your chore cleaning routine by creating a personalized adhd cleaning schedule with adhd organizer. Just select the rooms that you want to keep clean, and get an auto-generated house cleaning schedule created by our chores planner.\r\n\r\nSee all your rooms neatly organized on the main menu. Then tap on a room/area and see automated house chores to do list. Tap on any of the chores to set cleaning schedules (daily, weekly, monthly), reward points, and conditions.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc6<b>TRACK CHORES, SET REMINDERS</b>\r\nComplete the house chores within the chore checklists for each room with simple taps with adhd organizer. Track all completed chores in the \u201cReview\u201d tab with the chore tracker. Set daily house cleaning reminders with date and time using chore calendar. Chore tracker makes your life easy and your house clean and declutter.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc6a<b>INVITE HOME MEMBERS</b>\r\nChores are not only your duty! Delegate and manage chores with your spouse, kids, or roommates by inviting them to Housy. Share tasks, complete daily chores together on the chore chart, or plan and execute the house cleaning schedule in a smarter way.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6<b>STAY MOTIVATED WITH POINTS AND CHALLENGES</b>\r\nEarn reward points for each task on the chores chart and complete different house cleaning challenges within the app like the \u201cConsistency Challenge\u201d. Stay focused to declutter your home and keeping it spotless and tidy.\r\n\r\n\u2728HOUSY \u2013 CHORE PLANNER & HOME CLEANING SCHEDULE APP FEATURES:\r\n- Automatically generated personal house cleaning schedule makes chore home routine organization easy.\r\n- Daily Points! Track chore completion, and boost your house cleaning motivation!\r\n- Pre-set cleaning checklist and chore chart for every room. Just pick the one you need!\r\n- Task sharing & syncing. Seamless, fast.\r\n- Add custom tasks and rooms.\r\n- Our house chores tracker app works offline!\r\n- Challenges! Be more consistent, try the build-in challenge and stay on top of your cleaning checklist\r\n- Daily chores & self cleaning reminder\r\n- Invite home members to declutter \r\n- NO Ads.\r\n\r\nWith the visual approach of our chore checklist, you will ALWAYS know where to start and what to do for adhd cleaning. Our housework chores checklists are the best way to turn any cleaning schedule into an easier task.\r\n\r\nDaily chores shall be defeated. :)\r\nBest part? You will FEEL the progress.\r\n\r\n\u2705Try our household chores planner app for free!\r\n\r\n___________________\r\n\r\nREACH OUT\r\nIf you have queries or feature suggestions regarding our room cleaning chores app for adults, please send them at rogov.dmitry+houserion@gmail.com\r\n\r\nTill then complete your home cleaning productively and in a fun way with Housy \u2013 the ultimate house cleaning checklist app!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><h2>CLEAN YOUR HOME WITH HOUSY - CHORES TRACKER AND HOUSE CLEANING APP</h2></b><br><br>Are you looking for a free adhd cleaning &amp; house chores tracker app with cleaning schedules that you\u2019ll actually keep using to help declutter your house?<br><br>A home chore tracker and adhd organizer app that is easy to use and keeps you motivated to keep your house clean?<br><br>Meet <b>Housy</b>, a simple house cleaning checklists and chore calendar app for adults that will help you declutter and keep your home clean all the time. Use it as your chores calendar to plan and organize adhd cleaning, as well as a chores tracker to know which chores were completed using the chore chart.<br><br>Housekeeping, housing cleaning and home organization are easy with Housy!<br><br><b><h2>AUTO-GENERATED HOME CLEANING SCHEDULE</h2></b><br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 Have structure and discipline in your chore cleaning routine by creating a personalized adhd cleaning schedule with adhd organizer. Just select the rooms that you want to keep clean, and get an auto-generated house cleaning schedule created by our chores planner.<br><br>See all your rooms neatly organized on the main menu. Then tap on a room/area and see automated house chores to do list. Tap on any of the chores to set cleaning schedules (daily, weekly, monthly), reward points, and conditions.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc6<b>TRACK CHORES, SET REMINDERS</b><br>Complete the house chores within the chore checklists for each room with simple taps with adhd organizer. Track all completed chores in the \u201cReview\u201d tab with the chore tracker. Set daily house cleaning reminders with date and time using chore calendar. Chore tracker makes your life easy and your house clean and declutter.<br><br>\ud83d\udc6a<b>INVITE HOME MEMBERS</b><br>Chores are not only your duty! Delegate and manage chores with your spouse, kids, or roommates by inviting them to Housy. Share tasks, complete daily chores together on the chore chart, or plan and execute the house cleaning schedule in a smarter way.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6<b>STAY MOTIVATED WITH POINTS AND CHALLENGES</b><br>Earn reward points for each task on the chores chart and complete different house cleaning challenges within the app like the \u201cConsistency Challenge\u201d. Stay focused to declutter your home and keeping it spotless and tidy.<br><br>\u2728HOUSY \u2013 CHORE PLANNER &amp; HOME CLEANING SCHEDULE APP FEATURES:<br>- Automatically generated personal house cleaning schedule makes chore home routine organization easy.<br>- Daily Points! Track chore completion, and boost your house cleaning motivation!<br>- Pre-set cleaning checklist and chore chart for every room. Just pick the one you need!<br>- Task sharing &amp; syncing. Seamless, fast.<br>- Add custom tasks and rooms.<br>- Our house chores tracker app works offline!<br>- Challenges! Be more consistent, try the build-in challenge and stay on top of your cleaning checklist<br>- Daily chores &amp; self cleaning reminder<br>- Invite home members to declutter <br>- NO Ads.<br><br>With the visual approach of our chore checklist, you will ALWAYS know where to start and what to do for adhd cleaning. Our housework chores checklists are the best way to turn any cleaning schedule into an easier task.<br><br>Daily chores shall be defeated. :)<br>Best part? You will FEEL the progress.<br><br>\u2705Try our household chores planner app for free!<br><br>___________________<br><br>REACH OUT<br>If you have queries or feature suggestions regarding our room cleaning chores app for adults, please send them at rogov.dmitry+houserion@gmail.com<br><br>Till then complete your home cleaning productively and in a fun way with Housy \u2013 the ultimate house cleaning checklist app!",
